    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "use a pure LLM-as-a-Judge approach, using GPT-4o-mini as the judge\n",
        "to score responses from both LLaMA-3.3-70b (Groq) and GPT-4o-mini.\n",
        "\n",
        "Because this task nature requires semantic understanding. agricultural Q&A answers are open-minded and solutions may not be fixed.\n",
        "\n",
        "Using Gpt-4o-mini as judge because it has strong instruction-following ability for structured json output, and has sufficient reasoning capability for agricultural domain with cost efficiency.\n"
      ],
